   "text": "data-platform-dev-lambda (trust lambda.amazonaws.com)\n• logs:CreateLogStream/PutLogEvents\n(AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole)\n• s3:ListBucket raw · s3:GetObject/PutObject raw/bodacc/*\n• dynamodb:PutItem/UpdateItem pipeline_runs ·\nemr-serverless:GetJobRun\n• kms:Encrypt/Decrypt/GenerateDataKey sur la clé ·\ncloudwatch:PutMetricData",
