   "text": "data-platform-dev-emr (trust emr-serverless.amazonaws.com)\n• s3:GetObject raw/*, artifacts/* · s3:ListBucket (5\nbuckets)\n• s3:PutObject/DeleteObject processed/*, out/*, warehouse/*,\nlogs/*\n• glue:Get*/CreateTable/UpdateTable/BatchCreatePartition sur\ndb platform\n• kms data-key sur la clé · logs:* vers le log group EMR",
   "originalText": "data-platform-dev-emr (trust emr-serverless.amazonaws.com)\n• s3:GetObject raw/*, artifacts/* · s3:ListBucket (5 buckets)\n• s3:PutObject/DeleteObject processed/*, out/*, warehouse/*, logs/*\n• glue:Get*/CreateTable/UpdateTable/BatchCreatePartition sur db platform\n• kms data-key sur la clé · logs:* vers le log group EMR",
